Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Globe of Invulnerability\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp/30px-Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Globe_of_Invulnerability_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Globe_of_Invulnerability_(area)\" title=\"Globe of Invulnerability (area)\">Globe of Invulnerability</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>INVULNERABLE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Eternally_Bound\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eternally_Bound_(Condition)\" title=\"Eternally Bound (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eternally Bound\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-